        "created_at": "2017-03-17T16:27:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Keep in mind all of Omnitron's abilities work in a similar way. All three of his hexes, in theory, could&nbsp;be on&nbsp;different elevations (counting the +1 he has naturally) and all hexes could have very different Lines of Sight, so just make sure you specify which hex you are drawing your LoS from when making attacks and such.&nbsp;</p>",
